  "details": "I'll try to give as much details as possible, let me know if I miss something. I am not 100% positive if it is an issue with the game or my setup though, but it has something to do with the update. \nGame launched normally at first, I played a bit, exited the game, tried to launch it again and it just would not launch. Restarted SteamVR multiple times, still not launching. Restarted the PC, not launching. Exited the beta, and game launched on first try. This never happened to me before, I have 280 hours, and it only happening with the beta, and being fixed right away when I rolled back is unlikely to be a coincidence.\nSetup: Quest 2/ Virtual Desktop/ 2 Base stations 1.0s, 3 Vive trackers 3.0s/ windows 10/ 3070 Ti/ i5 11400 I had ovras/fpsvr/ovrtoolkit all open",
